| Broken token | Correct word | Note |
|---|---|---|
| `p?` | `på` | very high frequency |
| `s?` | `så` | |
| `f?r` | `för` | preposition; also verb `går`, depending on `g?r` |
| `g?r` | `går` or `gör` | check context |
| `h?r` | `här` | |
| `d?r` | `där` | |
| `n?r` | `när` | |
