## Guardrails

- Do NOT use StrReplace anywhere.
- Do NOT create intermediate files or debug scripts in `assets/powershell/`.
- Do NOT read the full HTML file unless Step 4 diagnosis requires it.
- Do NOT move, rename, or copy files.
- Do NOT update `assets/pages/newsletter.html`.
- Do NOT touch archive structure or image paths.
- Do NOT change charset/encoding declarations.
- Do NOT replace `?` inside `href` / `src` URL attribute values.
- Do NOT correct spelling errors — only replace FFFD characters.
- Report unresolved tokens honestly; never substitute a random Swedish letter.
